    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūsumo lwa ng'hoonà na nzabibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla gūlīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, ganaga lūgano ūbinhe lūsumo a banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage, Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, “Ng'hoonà nhaale ya booya wingī bo mabbado ga būlī mbika, na manana ga nguzu ga nzooya ndīhu; īkiza Lebanoni, yūgwa hitambī lya kwigūlya ya ntī gwa manga yūlīdima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna yūbbuta katambī kanagana ū kū neno yalyo, yūlala nako kūja kū sī ya basūlūja yūkakahamba mu nzengo gwa basūlūja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma yūsola mbīyū kūfuma ū mu sī ying'we, yūkīhamba h'ibbaala lībeegelejiwe lyūtūūlīlwa na mboleela, yūyīhamba gīt'igobeko hihī na minzī mingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūzwa yūkūla gūbiza nzabibu gūfulumile chiza gūūlandaala. A matambī ga nzabibu gīgalūkīla ī ng'hoonà yenīyo, nī miji yūhama a hasī. Gūūkūla gūbiza nzabibu gwaala matambī na kūfuluma madūūtū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo yalīho na ng'hoonà yīngī nhaale, ya manana ga nguzu na booya wingī. Ū nzabibu gwenūyo gwandya kūsonja ī miji kwīnga aho gwalī gūhambīlilwe, na a matambī gago gūūgagalūcha, kūīlīla ū kū ng'hoonà yenīyo, gūkwisagīlagwa kūpandīka minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo gwalī gūhambīlilwe mu sī soga na minzī mingī gaalīho ga kūgwīta gūbize nzabibu gwawiza, gwa matambī mingī na mizabibu misoga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage lūūlū, Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, “Ū nzabibu gwenūyo gūkūlama? Gūtūdubbūlwa pyī nī miji yago gahūlūlwe a matwajo, a matambī a managana ayo gakūsongaga ganyaale pye? Ū kūgūdubbūla jitūgongwa nguzu ningī, nūūlū ibità lya banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ūlū gwīnjiwa aho gwalī gūhambīlilwe gūsaamiwa, gūkūpīla gūfulume? Gūtūūma kūlū kūlū gete ūlū gūūtūlwa lūyaga lo kīya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla gūlīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī numba ya būshitiigwa yenīyī īwīlage, ‘Mūtūdeebaga ī mihayo yenīyī īlī na makūlū kī?’ Bawīlage gīkī, ‘Ū ntemi wa Babuloni akaja ī Yelusalemu ūūkansaamya ū ntemi wa kwene na a bana ng'oma bakwe, wiza nabo kūūnū Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūsola ūmò ū mu ba lūdūgū lwa ntemi, ūbeeja ilagane nang'hwe, ūng'wilahīja. Na a bataale bataale a bangī ū mu sī ūbasaamya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī ū būsugi būmajiwe ī shingilima, būtizūgūngūmūka hangī, wīmīīle mu nzīla ya kūdima ilagane lyakwe dūhū.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi ū mpya akangomela ū ntemi wa Babuloni; ūtūma nhūng'wa Misili gīkī akenhelwe falasa n'ibità lya bashilikale bingī. Akūdūla gete? Ū munhū wa kwīta īlī gīko akūpūlūgūka? Akūgelela kūkenaagūla ilagane dūhū alīyo ū wei ūpīla?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmo nene nalī mpanga; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU, akūchīla Babuloni, mu sī ya ntemi ūyo walī wantūūla ha būtemi, ūyo akadalaha shilahīlo shakwe, nī lilagane lyakwe ūlīkenaagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lya būlūgū ūlū gūūtūlīīlwa matūūgo ga malongo kūlwa kwingīla ū mu nzengo, jūpīndīlījiwa na ng'hambī kūlwa kūkenaagūla būpanga wa banhū bingī, ū Falao nī libità lyakwe lya banhū ba nguzu na bashilikale bingī, atīko kūngunanha ū ntemi ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno washidalaha ī shilahīlo ūbūkenaagūla ū būlagane ūbo walī wabūzunya ūbūtūūlīla na nkono gwakwe wei ng'wenekīlī, alīyo hū wīyīta pyī ī mihayo yenīyī; atūpīla!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya: Ūmo nene nalī mpanga, nakūng'winha nsango kūlwa shilahīlo shane īsho washidalaha, nī lilagane lyane īlo walīkenaagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūgoloola ikila lyane līngobanīje; lūkūmpuja ū lūtu lwane nantwale Babuloni; nakūjūng'winha nsango kwenūko, nguno ya kūbūkenaagūla ū būsanyiwa bokwe ū kūlī nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale bakwe abo abasanije bakūbūpeela ū būlūgū, alīyo bakūja bakūbūlagagwa nzīla ngima; abo balasaage bakūbbalasana bajile sagala; a henaho hū mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene SEEBA hū nahayaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya; Nene ng'wenekīlī nakwīnja itambī kūfuma kwigūlya ya manga nalīhambe; nakūtīna'itambī inagana kwīngīīla kū neno yago nakalīhambe kwigūlya ya lūgūlū lūlīhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūlīhamba kwigūlya ya ngūlū ja Isilaeli; gūkūkūla gūbize na matambī mingī gūtwaje matwajo; gūkūbiza manga gwawiza no. Noni ja būlī mbika jikūbeeja mo chanjo, jikūpandīka būhooyelo ū mu mbeho ya matambī gago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
